[00:00.680]She was a bird
{"她是一只鸟"}
[00:02.709]I was an arrow
{"我是一支箭"}
[00:04.934]Both of us sure we were
{"我们都确信自己是"}
[00:06.657]Sword and a sparrow
{"剑与麻雀"}
[00:08.702]Still when we flew
{"然而当我们飞翔时"}
[00:10.391]We never knew
{"我们从未知晓"}
[00:17.239]There in the air
{"在那空中"}
[00:19.297]I felt her feathers
{"我触到了她的羽毛"}
[00:21.313]First all at once
{"先是猝不及防"}
[00:23.450]Then all together
{"然后全然交织"}
[00:25.431]When I went through
{"当我穿透而过"}
[00:27.523]That's when I knew
{"那一刻我才明白"}
[00:33.452]I'm a killer and a killer is a bad, bad thing to be
{"我是个杀手，而杀手是件很坏、很坏的事"}
[00:37.409]She's a giver and a giver's even worse to folks like me
