[00:41.406]'Cause I never really wanna be the one to hurt somebody
{"因为我从不想成为伤害别人的人"}
[00:45.720]But it just keeps happening, yeah it just keeps happening
{"但它就是不断发生，是啊，它就是不断发生"}
