[01:25.254]He'd hate what he's doing
{"他会憎恶自己的所为"}
[01:27.428]And make me feel stupid
{"让我觉得自己愚蠢"}
[01:29.489]For choosing him too
{"因为选择了他"}
[01:31.101]'Cause I'm a giver and a giver is a bad, bad thing to be
{"只因我是个付出者，而付出者是件很糟很糟的事"}
[01:35.206]He's a killer and a killers even worse for folks like me
{"他是个杀手，而杀手对我这样的人来说更糟"}
[01:39.393]'Cause I never really wanna feel the hurt from anybody
{"因为我从不想感受任何人的伤害"}
[01:43.473]But it just keeps happening, yeah it just keeps happening
{"但它就是不断发生，是啊，就是不断发生"}
